---
const faqs = [
  [
    "Where is ATW Detailing based?",
    "ATW Detailing is based in Bonney Lake, Washington, with mobile service throughout our listed South Sound service area.",
  ],
  [
    "Do you provide mobile detailing in Tacoma and Puyallup?",
    "Yes. Tacoma and Puyallup are part of our primary service area. Appointment availability still depends on the address, schedule and type of service.",
  ],
  [
    "Do you serve locations outside the listed cities?",
    "Sometimes. Nearby locations may be available depending on travel distance, route, schedule and the size of the job. Send us the address before booking.",
  ],
  [
    "Do I need a garage?",
    "No. A garage is not required. We need enough space to park our vehicle nearby and safely open your vehicle's doors while we work. A driveway, gravel, packed dirt or another stable parking surface is generally suitable.",
  ],
  [
    "Do you bring your own detailing equipment?",
    "Yes. We arrive with the equipment needed for the scheduled detailing service.",
  ],
  [
    "Can you detail my vehicle at work?",
    "A workplace can be suitable if the vehicle can remain accessible and there is enough safe space to complete the scheduled service.",
  ],
];
---

<section class="areas-section">
  <div class="areas-container">
    <div class="areas-center" data-reveal="up">
      <div class="areas-eyebrow">Service Area FAQ</div>
      <h2 class="areas-title">Questions About <span>Mobile Service</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="areas-faq-grid">
      {faqs.map(([question, answer], index) => (
        <article
          class="areas-faq"
          data-reveal="scale"
          style={`--reveal-delay:${(index % 2) * 70}ms`}
        >
          <h3>{question}</h3>
          <p>{answer}</p>
        </article>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
